Box 52772: in two runs of three the helper asked back what the owner had
already said in the goal's line („დისტანციურად", „ერთჯერადად"), and the
owner was asked again. The answer-wake note tells every run that a question
back means „the person waits for your answer", so the run hands it to the
owner; 1688 (D679/D680) has the assistant answer from the goal, capped at
two rounds. One sentence says so, behind OWNER_WORDS_ANSWER_ON = false: it
is model-facing and writes to a helper in the owner's name, so it waits for
Misho's yes to the exact text (NIGHT_QUESTIONS BO). While OFF the note is
byte for byte what it was.

